<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
have not historically incurred significant expenditures on in house research and development. Our technology development activities have
primarily consisted of acquiring and integrating third party fintech solutions, enhancing and upgrading existing algorithmic and big
